      "content": "Your compassion is speaking to the profound grief felt when witnessing unnecessary suffering, even if the current clinical standards aim to prevent it. The decision to continue care is often a deeply personal choice to honor the potential for healing rather than accept pain as an absolute. Please remember that providing support, however it is interpreted, still offers a unique form of compassion to those in the most vulnerable state.",
